OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 22, charged over hit-and-run
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man has been charged following a
OL,6,Fhit-and-run in Renfrewshire.
OL,8,FPolice were called at about 09:10 on
OL,9,FSaturday following the incident on Lawn
OL,10,FStreet in Paisley.
OL,12,FA 74-year-old man and a 47-year-old
OL,13,Fwoman were taken to hospital for
OL,14,Ftreatment.
OL,16,FA Police Scotland spokesperson said:
OL,17,F"The 22-year-old male driver of the car
OL,18,Fwhich left the scene was traced by
OL,19,Fpolice a short time later and he was
OL,20,Farrested in connection."
